0..74 Comment "// A law of joining written over `std.string`\'s `concat` itself, which the"
75..128 Comment "// checker refuses until a law may name a definition."
129..131 Comment "//"
132..204 Comment "// A rule names only the operations of its own block. `concat` here is a"
205..283 Comment "// definition the block does not declare, so the rule is malformed. The module"
284..346 Comment "// states the same law over joining presented as an operation."
347..349 Comment "//"
350..428 Comment "// The block below names `concat` and `empty` from the import in its rule. The"
429..469 Comment "// description check refuses it by name."
